# Optional group: office suite and video production.
#
# Moved out of install/fedory-base.packages so bootstrap.sh can offer them as
# an opt-out choice -- together these are ~506 MiB, and they are the clearest
# case of software a desktop user may simply not want. See
# install/helpers/groups.sh.
#
# Names resolve through packaging/package-map.tsv like every other list.
kdenlive
libreoffice-fresh
obs-studio
